# DrugIQ – Models Directory

Mongoose model definitions live here.

## Planned Models

| File                  | Collection      | Description                           |
|-----------------------|-----------------|---------------------------------------|
| `Drug.js`             | `drugs`         | Drug name, conditions, side effects   |
| `Review.js`           | `reviews`       | Patient reviews, rating, sentiment    |
| `SideEffect.js`       | `sideeffects`   | Aggregated side-effect frequencies    |
| `Condition.js`        | `conditions`    | Medical conditions + related drugs    |

## Conventions

- All models must use `timestamps: true` in schema options.
- All schemas must define a `toJSON` transform to remove `__v` and rename `_id` to `id`.
- Index all fields used in filtering or sorting.
